meta {
  name: List automation connections
  type: http
  seq: 4
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/organizations/{{organization_id}}/automation-connections
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
}

docs {
  The accounts automations can act through, such as GitHub, Jira or PagerDuty, with each one’s status, whether it is paused and whether its triggers can fire. `actions` lists what you can do with each one, in order — `test`, `reconnect` or `replace_key`, `rename`, `pause`, `disconnect` — and `needs_reconnect` is true when the provider no longer accepts its access, so reconnecting or replacing the key brings it back without changing its id.

  Scope: `monitoring.read`
}
